---
description: Motion and animation rules inspired by tasteful design engineering
globs: ["app/**/*.tsx", "src/**/*.tsx", "components/**/*.tsx"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Use animation only when it improves emotion, clarity, or perceived quality.

Good uses:
- Soft hero entrance
- Gentle photo reveal
- Smooth section transitions
- Subtle RSVP button hover/tap feedback
- Elegant timeline reveal
- Small ornamental motion, if restrained

Avoid:
- Bouncy cartoon motion
- Over-animated text
- Constant movement
- Distracting parallax
- Heavy scroll effects
- Animations that hurt performance

Motion should feel:
- Calm
- Refined
- Romantic
- Smooth
- Premium

Prefer:
- Short durations
- Natural easing
- Opacity + transform animations
- Respecting reduced motion preferences

Always support prefers-reduced-motion.